{"id":"6653f26a3d0abcec","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-kurtz-low.md","title":"Kurtz随机低性与检验低性","display":"df-kurtz-low — Kurtz随机低性与检验低性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-kurtz-low","aliases":["43-df-kurtz-low"],"display":"df-kurtz-low — Kurtz随机低性与检验低性","depends_on":["[[43-df-kurtzrandom]]","[[43-df-kurtz-null-test]]","[[43-df-pi01class]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"§16.4 introductory paragraphs; printed p.501 / PDF p.521; Definition 10.5.2, printed p.233 / PDF p.253","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-kurtz-low"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-kurtz-low</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kurtz-low — Kurtz随机低性与检验低性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1b1a52dd1295c33c\" href=\"?note=1b1a52dd1295c33c\" title=\"43-df-kurtzrandom\">43-df-kurtzrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1e7f22030c79f92b\" href=\"?note=1e7f22030c79f92b\" title=\"43-df-kurtz-null-test\">43-df-kurtz-null-test</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§16.4 introductory paragraphs; printed p.501 / PDF p.521; Definition 10.5.2, printed p.233 / PDF p.253"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 的 Borel σ 代数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(U,V\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_e\">\\(E_e\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}\">\\(\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1e7f22030c79f92b\" href=\"?note=1e7f22030c79f92b\" title=\"43-df-kurtz-null-test\">43-df-kurtz-null-test</a> 的有限串代码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotalComputable}^A\">\\(\\operatorname{TotalComputable}^A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}\">\\(\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1b1a52dd1295c33c\" href=\"?note=1b1a52dd1295c33c\" title=\"43-df-kurtzrandom\">43-df-kurtzrandom</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 的Cantor空间公平硬币Borel概率测度，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}\">\\(\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}\\)</span>。本节引入相对检验 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}^A\">\\(\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}^A\\)</span>、相对随机性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}^A\">\\(\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}^A\\)</span> 及两个一元低性谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForKurtz}\">\\(\\mathrm{LowForKurtz}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForKurtzTest}\">\\(\\mathrm{LowForKurtzTest}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}^A(U)\\iff\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{TotalComputable}^A(f)\\land\\forall n\\;\\left[U_n=\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in E_{f(n)}}[\\sigma]\\land\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in E_{f(n)}}[\\sigma]\\right)\\le2^{-n}\\right]\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}^A(U)\\iff\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{TotalComputable}^A(f)\\land\\forall n\\;\\left[U_n=\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in E_{f(n)}}[\\sigma]\\land\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in E_{f(n)}}[\\sigma]\\right)\\le2^{-n}\\right]\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}^A(X)\\iff\\forall P\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\left(\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}(P)\\land\\mu(P)=0\\Rightarrow X\\notin P\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}^A(X)\\iff\\forall P\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\left(\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}(P)\\land\\mu(P)=0\\Rightarrow X\\notin P\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForKurtz}(A)\\iff\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}^A(X)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LowForKurtz}(A)\\iff\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}^A(X)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForKurtzTest}(A)\\iff\\forall U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}^A(U)\\Rightarrow\\exists V\\;\\left[\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}(V)\\land\\bigcap_nU_n\\subseteq\\bigcap_nV_n\\right]\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LowForKurtzTest}(A)\\iff\\forall U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}^A(U)\\Rightarrow\\exists V\\;\\left[\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}(V)\\land\\bigcap_nU_n\\subseteq\\bigcap_nV_n\\right]\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按书中区别保留随机类低性与检验覆盖低性两个谓词。相对化作用于统一计算有限闭开分量的函数，不改变公平硬币测度；不能仅说每一分量分别A可计算。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，§16.4 introductory paragraphs; printed p.501 / PDF p.521; Definition 10.5.2, printed p.233 / PDF p.253。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-kurtzrandom","status":"resolved","id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kurtzrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kurtz-null-test","status":"resolved","id":"1e7f22030c79f92b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kurtz-null-test]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi01class","status":"resolved","id":"cc07cf2b9ec0019e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pi01class]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 是 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的 Borel σ 代数。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kurtz-null-test","status":"resolved","id":"1e7f22030c79f92b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；$U,V\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。$E_e$ 与 $\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}$ 采用 [[43-df-kurtz-null-test]] 的有限串代码；$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}^A$、$\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}$、$\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]、[[43-df-pi01class]]、[[43-df-kurtzrandom]]。$\\mu$ 为 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的Cantor空间公平硬币Borel概率测度，满足 $\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}$。本节引入相对检验 $\\mat